    "title": "National Burrito Day deals 2026 on April 2",
    "text": "National Burrito Day 2026 is Thursday, April 2 and there are some delicious deals! Read on for the list of offers. Posted 3/31/2026, 10:34:22 PM Updated 4/2/2026, 6:29:29 PM Moe's Southwest Grill National Burrito Day * Photo courtesy Moe's Southwest Grill National Burrito Day 2026 is Thursday, April 2 and there are some delicious deals! Read on for the list of offers. Keep in mind that these deals are only valid at participating locations. Bubbakoo’s Burritos Bubbakoo’s Burritos is offering a Buy One, Get One Free burrito promotion valid on any entrée for online and in-store orders on April 2, 2026 at participating locations. According to their press release: \" Customers visiting in-store simply need to mention the National Burrito Day offer at checkout, while those ordering online or through the Bubbakoo’s app can redeem the deal by entering the promo code BURRITODAY at checkout.\" Their website indicates that in the Triangle, there is a location at 8202 Renaissance Pkwy #103, Durham, NC. Chipotle Chipotle is offering $0 delivery on April 2, 2026 with the code DELIVER at checkout, according to their Facebook page and the e-mail sent to subscribers on April 2. Valid at participating locations with a minimum order of $10. In addition, try to unlock the Chipotle Burrito Vault through April 1, 2026 for a chance to win one of millions of prizes including Free Burritos for a Year, BOGOs, and Double Protein. Moe's Southwest Grill Reward members get a Buy One, Get One Free burrito or bowl online or in-store at participating Moe’s Southwest Grill locations from March 31-April 2, 2026. Non-reward members can get the offer on April 2, 2026 in-restaurant when you mention the offer. QDOBA On Thursday, April 2, 2026, QDOBA reward members get a free Burrito or Bowl with the purchase of an entrée & drink online or in the restaurant at participating locations. See the details on their website. Tijuana Flats On April 2, 2026, Tijuana Flats is offering a free “Make It Wet” upgrade with any burrito purchase, which means customers can get their burrito smothered in queso, red sauce, or verde when you use promo code SAUCED26 at checkout at participating locations. See the details on the e-mail sent to subscribers on April 1. In addition, on Thursdays, Tijuana Flats offers a burrito or bowl, chips, and a drink for $8.99 at participating locations in-store and on their app or website. Torchy's Tacos On April 2, 2026 Torchy's Tacos is offering $5 Breakfast Burritos in-restaurant until 2 p.m. at participating locations. See the offer posted on their Facebook page. See additional grocery deals and retail deals on the WRAL Smart Shopper page HERE! . © 2026 Copyright Capitol Broadcasting Company",
